It is Monday morning.
I make a cup of hot tea.
I sit at the table in the kitchen.
I open my calendar.
I always plan my week here.
It is February now.
The month is already very full.
Tomorrow is Tuesday.
My bicycle is unfortunately broken.
I walk to the bicycle mechanic tomorrow morning.
He opens at eight o'clock.
I write it in the calendar.
I also call the hairdresser today.
My hair is way too long.
Wednesday I go to the gym.
I often train on Wednesdays.
It is usually at seven o'clock in the evening.
I look at my plan again.
I drink my tea.
Now I am ready for a new week.
